  "answer": "Blore is employed by The Dean (Augustin Jedd) at the Deanery. The Dean, burdened by bills, is tempted by Blore to bet on the horse Dandy Dick, and Blore, to ensure his own bet on Bonny-Betsy, poisons Dandy Dick. Meanwhile, The Dean's daughters, Sheba and Salome, ask him for money, but he refuses, citing their extravagant bills. Later, The Dean discovers a bill for costumes from a masked ball, implicating Sheba and Salome, and sends them to their rooms.",
